WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:09.420
Welcome to our second investor
meeting with Babylon Capital.

2
00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:16.660
I'm Henrik Hallenborg, and
joining me is our CEO, Fredrik.

3
00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.860
Good evening, Fredrik. Good evening.

4
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:27.920
Tonight we'll discuss how things have
developed since our last meeting.

5
00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:35.360
Feel free to enter your
questions in the question box

6
00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:38.860
as they come to mind.

7
00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:41.320
We'll also have a Q&A session at the end.

8
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:46.380
But you can submit your questions beforehand.

9
00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.940
Let's start with...

10
00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:58.809
